TACT Extension (personal customization)
Based on Comfortable NU, Apache License 2.0.
Original project: https://github.com/rozwer/comfortable-NU
Base commit: 79f65b651f92584ac25445f9c62f2a854deeff2e
Original authors: Kazuki Takeda, Shoji Kajita, rozwer.

2026-10-02 modifications: course-specific incremental file downloads and
permission recovery, completion-aware Calendar reminder creation/update/deletion,
and a ChatGPT file-attachment / prompt-preparation adapter.

The ChatGPT DOM interaction approach references RightClickGPT:
https://github.com/eimexdev/RightClickGPT (Apache-2.0).
The adapter is independently implemented, does not embed the extension,
and never automatically submits a ChatGPT prompt.
